 "bloques": [
  "<div class=\"recuerda\">\n    <div class=\"recuerda-titulo\">💡 Recuerda</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">Los <strong>cuerpos geométricos</strong> tienen volumen (se pueden coger con la mano). Este año conocemos dos nuevos: el <strong>prisma</strong> y la <strong>pirámide</strong>.</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-figuras\">\n      <div class=\"rf-caja\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <polygon points=\"10,22 22,10 52,10 40,22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"40,22 52,10 52,40 40,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"10\" y=\"22\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"rf-nombre\">cubo</span>\n        <span class=\"rf-info\">6 caras iguales</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rf-caja\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <polygon points=\"6,26 16,16 48,16 38,26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"38,26 48,16 48,38 38,48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"6\" y=\"26\" width=\"32\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"rf-nombre\">prisma</span>\n        <span class=\"rf-info\">como una caja</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rf-caja\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"10,46 30,54 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"10,46 30,40 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"rf-nombre\">pirámide</span>\n        <span class=\"rf-info\">caras triángulo + punta</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rf-caja\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"rf-nombre\">esfera</span>\n        <span class=\"rf-info\">redonda, rueda</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rf-caja\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"46\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 14 48 A 16 5 0 0 0 46 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 14 48 A 16 5 0 0 1 46 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"rf-nombre\">cilindro</span>\n        <span class=\"rf-info\">2 caras planas, rueda</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rf-caja\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 12 46 A 18 5 0 0 0 48 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 12 46 A 18 5 0 0 1 48 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n        <span class=\"rf-nombre\">cono</span>\n        <span class=\"rf-info\">1 cara plana + punta</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">1.</span> <strong>Une</strong> cada cuerpo geométrico con su <strong>nombre</strong>:</div>\n    <div class=\"unir-grid\">\n      <div class=\"unir-col\">\n        <div class=\"unir-fig\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n            <polygon points=\"6,26 16,16 48,16 38,26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <polygon points=\"38,26 48,16 48,38 38,48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <rect x=\"6\" y=\"26\" width=\"32\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"unir-fig\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 12 46 A 18 5 0 0 0 48 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 12 46 A 18 5 0 0 1 48 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"unir-fig\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n            <polyline points=\"10,46 30,54 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <polyline points=\"10,46 30,40 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"unir-fig\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n            <polygon points=\"10,22 22,10 52,10 40,22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <polygon points=\"40,22 52,10 52,40 40,52\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n            <rect x=\"10\" y=\"22\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"unir-fig\">\n          <svg viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n            <ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n            <line x1=\"46\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 14 48 A 16 5 0 0 0 46 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n            <path d=\"M 14 48 A 16 5 0 0 1 46 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"unir-col\">\n        <div class=\"unir-nom\">cubo</div>\n        <div class=\"unir-nom\">pirámide</div>\n        <div class=\"unir-nom\">prisma</div>\n        <div class=\"unir-nom\">cilindro</div>\n        <div class=\"unir-nom\">cono</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">2.</span> <strong>Rodea</strong> los cuerpos que terminan en <strong>punta</strong> (pirámides y conos):</div>\n    <div class=\"rodear-mosaico\">\n      <div class=\"rodear-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"10,46 30,54 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"10,46 30,40 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rodear-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rodear-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"48\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 12 46 A 18 5 0 0 0 48 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 12 46 A 18 5 0 0 1 48 46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rodear-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <polygon points=\"6,26 16,16 48,16 38,26\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polygon points=\"38,26 48,16 48,38 38,48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"6\" y=\"26\" width=\"32\" height=\"22\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rodear-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"10\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"50\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"30\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"54\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"10,46 30,54 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n          <polyline points=\"10,46 30,40 50,46\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rodear-fig\">\n        <svg class=\"figura-mini\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n          <ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"12\" rx=\"16\" ry=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"14\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"14\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"46\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"46\" y2=\"48\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 14 48 A 16 5 0 0 0 46 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n          <path d=\"M 14 48 A 16 5 0 0 1 46 48\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3,2\"/>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">3.</span> <strong>Completa</strong> las frases con el nombre del cuerpo:</div>\n    <div class=\"frases\">\n      <div class=\"frase\">a) El <span class=\"hueco-frase\"></span> tiene 6 caras iguales.</div>\n      <div class=\"frase\">b) La <span class=\"hueco-frase\"></span> termina en punta y sus caras son triángulos.</div>\n      <div class=\"frase\">c) El <span class=\"hueco-frase\"></span> tiene forma de caja.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">4.</span> <strong>Rodea</strong> V si es verdadero o F si es falso:</div>\n    <div class=\"vf-lista\">\n      <div class=\"vf-item\"><span>La esfera es redonda y puede rodar.</span><span class=\"vf-opciones\">V&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;F</span></div>\n      <div class=\"vf-item\"><span>El cono termina en punta.</span><span class=\"vf-opciones\">V&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;F</span></div>\n      <div class=\"vf-item\"><span>La pirámide es redonda.</span><span class=\"vf-opciones\">V&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;F</span></div>\n      <div class=\"vf-item\"><span>El prisma tiene forma de caja.</span><span class=\"vf-opciones\">V&nbsp;&nbsp;·&nbsp;&nbsp;F</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>"
